    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9040" root="حمد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمَدَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>sound of the flaming,</i> or <i>blazing,</i>
of fire; (S, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدَمَةٌ</span> [from which it is
formed by transposition: see 8: and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمْدٌ</span></b>  app.
signifies the same: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدْمٌ</span>]. (TA.)

